  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "25145892",
      "title": "The \"_document.js\" File (And What It Does)",
      "lectureOrder": 310,
      "videoOrder": 288,
      "sourceHash": "ead4efadc24257e0f53cc8440c92d8e011d11142985d0aafdb087ce0319b5382",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.22,
          "end": 4.5,
          "en": "Now the underscore app JS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.5,
          "end": 7.81,
          "en": "is not the only special next JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.81,
          "end": 11.88,
          "en": "which allows us to set application wide settings.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.88,
          "end": 15.7,
          "en": "There also is the underscore document.JS file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.7,
          "end": 20.233,
          "en": "which we can add just like _app def _document JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 22.76,
          "end": 25.78,
          "en": "has to be added in the pages folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 25.78,
          "end": 29.07,
          "en": "directly in the pages folder, not in some sub folder,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 29.07,
          "end": 32.17,
          "en": "but in the root level of the pages folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 32.17,
          "end": 33.57,
          "en": "It's not there by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 33.57,
          "end": 37.31,
          "en": "but if you add it next JS will take it into account",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.31,
          "end": 38.55,
          "en": "and we'll use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.55,
          "end": 41.14,
          "en": "But what does documentary JS do.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 41.14,
          "end": 44.93,
          "en": "App JS is your application shell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 44.93,
          "end": 48.07,
          "en": "You can imagine app JS as the root component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 48.07,
          "end": 53.03,
          "en": "inside of the body section of your HTML document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 53.03,
          "end": 55.53,
          "en": "Document JS allows you to customize",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 55.53,
          "end": 58.46,
          "en": "the entire HTML document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.46,
          "end": 62.595,
          "en": "So all the elements that make up an HTML document,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 62.595,
          "end": 64.3,
          "en": "if you need to do that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.3,
          "end": 67.26,
          "en": "you can add to the _documented JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 67.26,
          "end": 70.263,
          "en": "And then you need to add a special component in there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 71.16,
          "end": 74.53,
          "en": "a class-based component, as it turns out,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.53,
          "end": 77.07,
          "en": "which you could name my document,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 79.16,
          "en": "and it has to be a class-based component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 79.16,
          "end": 82.46000000000001,
          "en": "because it must extend some component offered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 82.46000000000001,
          "end": 85.05,
          "en": "and provided by next JS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 85.05,
          "end": 89.1,
          "en": "for this we need to add an import a import of document",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.1,
          "end": 91.973,
          "en": "from next slash document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.81,
          "end": 95.92,
          "en": "So we need to extend document here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 95.92,
          "end": 98.89,
          "en": "and therefore we need to use a class based component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.89,
          "end": 101.86,
          "en": "And then in this class based component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 101.86,
          "end": 104.77000000000001,
          "en": "we need to add a render method like we do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 104.77000000000001,
          "end": 107.34,
          "en": "in class based react components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 107.34,
          "end": 110.12299999999999,
          "en": "And then here we return some JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 111.03,
          "end": 114.08,
          "en": "That also should be special JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 114.08,
          "end": 116.513,
          "en": "with a very specific structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 119.84,
          "en": "For this we need to import more components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 119.84,
          "end": 122.07,
          "en": "from next document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 122.07,
          "end": 126.07,
          "en": "And those components are the HTML component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 126.07,
          "end": 130.13,
          "en": "the head component, the main component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 130.13,
          "end": 132.883,
          "en": "and the next script component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 133.89,
          "end": 136.59,
          "en": "Very important the head component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.59,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "which we are importing here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 142.88,
          "en": "is not the same head component as we import from next head.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 142.88,
          "end": 145.48,
          "en": "These are different components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.48,
          "end": 149.48,
          "en": "Head from next head is important to use it anywhere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 149.48,
          "end": 152.928,
          "en": "in your JSX code to adjust the head content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.928,
          "end": 155.12,
          "en": "of the rendered page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.12,
          "end": 157.64,
          "en": "head imported from next document",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 157.64,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "should only be used in this special document component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 162.563,
          "en": "which we are building here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.73,
          "end": 166.09,
          "en": "Now with those components imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 166.09,
          "end": 169.52,
          "en": "in the rendered JSX content here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.52,
          "end": 173.38,
          "en": "we should return a JSX structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 173.38,
          "end": 177.98,
          "en": "where we have the HTML element as a rapper.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 177.98,
          "end": 180.65,
          "en": "Then we have the head element like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 180.65,
          "end": 184.73,
          "en": "and then we have a body HTML element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 184.73,
          "end": 187.11,
          "en": "so no special component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 187.11,
          "end": 191.78,
          "en": "but the standard body element and inside of that main,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 191.78,
          "end": 194.893,
          "en": "and next script like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 195.85,
          "end": 198.4,
          "en": "that is the default structure, which you should add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 198.4,
          "end": 200.15,
          "en": "And that's the default structure,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 200.15,
          "end": 204.42000000000002,
          "en": "which the default document has if you don't override it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 204.42000000000002,
          "end": 206.01,
          "en": "So if you override it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 206.01,
          "end": 208.61,
          "en": "you wanna recreate that structure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.61,
          "end": 211.94,
          "en": "and you should also of course export the document",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 211.94,
          "end": 213.99,
          "en": "as the default.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.99,
          "end": 216.4,
          "en": "Now what could be reasons for overriding",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.4,
          "end": 218.3,
          "en": "that default document?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.3,
          "end": 222.59,
          "en": "Well if you want to configure that general document,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 222.59,
          "end": 226.34,
          "en": "for example if you wanna add the Lang attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.34,
          "end": 231.34,
          "en": "on HTML and set this to en if we don't do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 232,
          "end": 235.13,
          "en": "and save everything and we reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 235.13,
          "end": 237.4,
          "en": "we see that there is no Lang attribute",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 237.4,
          "end": 239.863,
          "en": "on the rendered HTML element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 241.09,
          "end": 244.61,
          "en": "If we do that, if we add Lang and set this to en",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 244.61,
          "end": 248.21,
          "en": "or to whichever language applies to your page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 248.21,
          "end": 251.21,
          "en": "then if we restart the Dev Server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 251.21,
          "end": 253.18,
          "en": "which we need to do here once,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 253.18,
          "end": 257.1,
          "en": "if we reload the page there after we see the Lang attribute,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 257.1,
          "end": 259.29,
          "en": "so I needed to restart the server here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 259.29,
          "end": 260.66,
          "en": "for this to have an effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 260.66,
          "end": 263.533,
          "en": "but then we see that this is taken into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 264.75,
          "end": 267.98,
          "en": "We could also add other elements here to the body,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 267.98,
          "end": 272.487,
          "en": "like for example a div with an idea of overlays like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.06,
          "end": 275.933,
          "en": "If we do that and save this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 277.63,
          "end": 281.06,
          "en": "and we reload we see in the body there is this div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 281.06,
          "end": 282.9,
          "en": "why might we wanna do that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.9,
          "end": 287.12,
          "en": "Well this allows us to add HTML content outside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 287.12,
          "end": 290.04,
          "en": "of our application component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 290.04,
          "end": 292.52,
          "en": "For example for using those elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 292.52,
          "end": 294.4,
          "en": "with react portals then",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 294.4,
          "end": 297.13,
          "en": "we could select this div with a react portal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 297.13,
          "end": 301.61,
          "en": "to portal our modals or overlays to this element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 301.61,
          "end": 304.42,
          "en": "So having extra HTML elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 304.42,
          "end": 307.73,
          "en": "which are outside of our application components tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 307.73,
          "end": 309.81,
          "en": "can sometimes be useful",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 309.81,
          "end": 312.35,
          "en": "because you are next to JS application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 312.35,
          "end": 314.8,
          "en": "is in the end rendered by this main component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 314.8,
          "end": 316.49,
          "en": "which would therefore must include,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 316.49,
          "end": 320.73,
          "en": "but adding extra elements can sometimes also be beneficial",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 320.73,
          "end": 325.38,
          "en": "and therefore If you need to edit the overall HTML document,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 325.38,
          "end": 329.173,
          "en": "you can do this by adding such _document JS file.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
